WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.384
Emperor Yang of Sui sat upon his glittering golden dragon throne.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:08.510
With a great wave of his hand, he ordered three expeditions against Goguryeo.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.028
The ministers in the court knelt to receive his command.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.138
The emperor's ambition grew ever greater.

00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:20.000
Outside the city gate, great numbers of soldiers and laborers set out in formation.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:23.206
The grain-supply carts stretched as far as the eye could see.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:27.420
On the distant mountain roads, wind and rain lashed down together.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:32.066
The soldiers were cold and exhausted, their steps growing slower and slower.

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:34.624
The war brought no victory.

00:00:34.974 --> 00:00:39.798
The exhausted army retreated through the heavy rain, heads bowed in dejection.

00:00:40.148 --> 00:00:42.692
The soldiers only wanted to get home soon.

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:47.170
Yet the common people back home had to hand over still more grain.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.072
The taxes grew heavier and heavier, and everyone suffered beyond words.

00:00:51.422 --> 00:00:53.966
Dark clouds massed over the palace.

00:00:54.316 --> 00:00:57.868
Years of war deepened the conflicts within the country ever further.

00:00:58.218 --> 00:01:01.650
The rule of the Sui dynasty began to totter.

